<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Legal — Bouncer' }) %>
<%- include('partials/nav-public', { active: 'legal' }) %>

<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-2">Legal</h1>
  <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-gray-500 mb-8">Last updated: April 2026</p>

  <div class="flex gap-4 mb-10 text-sm">
    <a href="#privacy" class="text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-700 dark:hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a>
    <span class="text-slate-300 dark:text-gray-700">·</span>
    <a href="#terms" class="text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-700 dark:hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">Terms of Use</a>
  </div>

  <section id="privacy" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-20">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 mb-6 pb-2 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Privacy Policy</h2>

    <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      Bouncer is a Telegram bot that gates group access using Enjin NFT ownership.
      This policy describes what data we collect, why, and what you can do about it.
      We try to keep it short and plain.
    </p>

    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-gray-100 mt-8 mb-3">What we collect</h3>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm list-disc pl-5 leading-relaxed">
      <li><strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-gray-200">From Telegram:</strong> your Telegram ID, username (if set), and first name. Needed to identify you in groups and on the dashboard.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-gray-200">From wallet verification:</strong> your Enjin wallet address and the timestamp you linked it. This is the public on-chain address &mdash; we never see private keys.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-gray-200">Group data:</strong> the Telegram ID and title of each group Bouncer is added to, along with per-member verification status, deadlines, and last-checked times.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-gray-200">Audit logs:</strong> automated records of verifications, kicks, bans, and admin rule changes, visible to group admins only.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-gray-200">Session cookies:</strong> when you log into the dashboard, a session cookie keeps you authenticated. Stored server-side, not shared with third parties.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-gray-200">Contact form submissions:</strong> if you use the contact form, the message and the handle/email you provide are sent to us by email. Not stored in our database.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-gray-100 mt-8 mb-3">How we use it</h3>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm list-disc pl-5 leading-relaxed">
      <li>Check whether you hold the NFT(s) required by a group you're in.</li>
      <li>Enforce access rules (mute, delete messages, or remove members who don't meet the rules).</li>
      <li>Show group admins a dashboard of their members, rules, and audit history.</li>
      <li>Respond to contact form messages.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm mt-3">
      We do <strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-gray-200">not</strong> sell your data, run advertising, or share it with
      analytics / marketing providers.
    </p>

    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-gray-100 mt-8 mb-3">Who we share it with</h3>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm list-disc pl-5 leading-relaxed">
      <li><strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-gray-200">Hetzner</strong> &mdash; our hosting provider. Everything listed above is stored in a self-hosted PostgreSQL database on our own server there.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-gray-200">Telegram</strong> &mdash; we call the Bot API to read group updates and enforce rules.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-gray-200">Enjin Platform</strong> &mdash; we query their GraphQL API with your wallet address to check NFT ownership. Your wallet address is public on-chain data.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-gray-200">SMTP provider</strong> &mdash; used only to deliver contact form messages to us.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-gray-100 mt-8 mb-3">Retention</h3>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm list-disc pl-5 leading-relaxed">
      <li>Your wallet link stays until you run <code class="text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-300 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900 px-1 rounded">/unlink</code> or request deletion.</li>
      <li>Audit logs for a group persist until the group is removed from Bouncer.</li>
      <li>Contact form emails are kept in our inbox as long as needed to respond.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-gray-100 mt-8 mb-3">Your rights</h3>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm list-disc pl-5 leading-relaxed">
      <li>Run <code class="text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-300 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900 px-1 rounded">/unlink</code> in a DM with the bot to remove the wallet association.</li>
      <li>Leave a group at any time &mdash; the bot stops tracking you once you're out.</li>
      <li>Request full data deletion via the <a href="/contact" class="text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-700 dark:hover:text-cyan-300">contact form</a>.</li>
      <li>Ask what data we hold on you via the contact form.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="terms" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-20">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 mb-6 pb-2 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Terms of Use</h2>

    <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      By using Bouncer &mdash; either as a group admin who adds the bot, or as a member in
      a gated group &mdash; you agree to these terms.
    </p>

    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-gray-100 mt-8 mb-3">The service</h3>
    <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      Bouncer controls access to Telegram groups based on Enjin NFT ownership. Admins
      configure rules (collection / token / minimum balance). Members verify their
      wallet to satisfy the rules and keep access.
    </p>

    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-gray-100 mt-8 mb-3">Eligibility</h3>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm list-disc pl-5 leading-relaxed">
      <li>You need a Telegram account.</li>
      <li>You must control the Enjin wallet you link &mdash; linking a wallet you don't own is a violation of these terms.</li>
      <% if (earlyAccess) { %>
      <li>To add Bouncer to a group as an admin, you must hold a valid <strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-gray-200">Bouncer MFT</strong> (early access requirement).</li>
      <% } %>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-gray-100 mt-8 mb-3">Acceptable use</h3>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm list-disc pl-5 leading-relaxed">
      <li>Don't try to bypass access controls (multi-accounts, spoofed wallets, etc.).</li>
      <li>Don't abuse the contact form, dashboard, or bot commands.</li>
      <li>Don't use the service for anything illegal.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-gray-100 mt-8 mb-3">Disclaimer</h3>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm list-disc pl-5 leading-relaxed">
      <li>The service is provided <strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-gray-200">as is</strong>, without warranty of any kind.</li>
      <li>We don't guarantee uptime. Verification depends on Telegram and the Enjin blockchain &mdash; third-party outages can cause delays or failed checks.</li>
      <li>We're not responsible for the value, transferability, or state of any NFT.</li>
      <li>Group admins are responsible for their own rules and the consequences of those rules.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-gray-100 mt-8 mb-3">Termination</h3>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm list-disc pl-5 leading-relaxed">
      <li>We can suspend or revoke access at any time for abuse.</li>
      <li>You can stop using Bouncer at any time &mdash; unlink your wallet or leave the group.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-gray-100 mt-8 mb-3">Changes</h3>
    <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      These terms may change as the service evolves. Major changes will be announced in
      the bot or on this page. Continued use after a change means you accept it.
    </p>

    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-gray-100 mt-8 mb-3">Contact</h3>
    <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      Questions about this policy or these terms? Reach us via the
      <a href="/contact" class="text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-700 dark:hover:text-cyan-300">contact form</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <a href="/" class="inline-block text-sm text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-700 dark:hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">&larr; Back to home</a>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
